{"id":"d8b0dff1fbe3e5a5","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points.md","title":"Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点","display":"Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points","aliases":["14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points"],"display":"Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame]]","[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"382a1dd68ab6f77b\" href=\"?note=382a1dd68ab6f77b\" title=\"14-df-frame\">14-df-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"382a1dd68ab6f77b\" href=\"?note=382a1dd68ab6f77b\" title=\"14-df-frame\">14-df-frame</a> 的框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> 采用该条显式定义的两元素框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq|L|\">\\(F\\subseteq|L|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\leftrightarrow\\top_L\\in F\\land\\bot_L\\notin F\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\in F\\land a\\le b\\Rightarrow b\\in F)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\ a\\wedge b\\in F\\land\\forall S\\subseteq|L|\\ (\\bigvee S\\in F\\Rightarrow S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\leftrightarrow\\top_L\\in F\\land\\bot_L\\notin F\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\in F\\land a\\le b\\Rightarrow b\\in F)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\ a\\wedge b\\in F\\land\\forall S\\subseteq|L|\\ (\\bigvee S\\in F\\Rightarrow S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsFrmHom}(\\mathbf1_F,L,\\mathbf2),\\qquad\\mathbf1_F(a):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;a\\in F,\\\\0&amp;a\\notin F.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsFrmHom}(\\mathbf1_F,L,\\mathbf2),\\qquad\\mathbf1_F(a):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;a\\in F,\\\\0&amp;a\\notin F.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.2。上闭和交闭对应保持二元交及顶，完全素性对应保持任意上确界；底不在 F 排除不真滤子。由逆像 h^{-1}({1}) 给出逆对应，解释 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"288974bbe429c3b2\" href=\"?note=288974bbe429c3b2\" title=\"14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence\">14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence</a> 的 locale 点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame","status":"resolved","id":"382a1dd68ab6f77b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame","status":"resolved","id":"382a1dd68ab6f77b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[14-df-frame]] 的框架，$\\mathbf2$ 采用该条显式定义的两元素框架，$F\\subseteq|L|$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"288974bbe429c3b2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IX.2。上闭和交闭对应保持二元交及顶，完全素性对应保持任意上确界；底不在 F 排除不真滤子。由逆像 h^{-1}({1}) 给出逆对应，解释 [[14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence]] 的 locale 点。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq|L|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\leftrightarrow\\top_L\\in F\\land\\bot_L\\notin F\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\in F\\land a\\le b\\Rightarrow b\\in F)\\land\\forall a,b\\in F\\ a\\wedge b\\in F\\land\\forall S\\subseteq|L|\\ (\\bigvee S\\in F\\Rightarrow S\\cap F\\ne\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsCompletelyPrimeFilter}_L(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsFrmHom}(\\mathbf1_F,L,\\mathbf2),\\qquad\\mathbf1_F(a):=\\begin{cases}1&a\\in F,\\\\0&a\\notin F.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1258,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points|Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points|Definition — 完全素滤子与 locale 点]]"},{"id":"13fcf2998466e976","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$h$ 的零逆像对任意并封闭，故其并仍映到0，并且零逆像恰为该并的下闭集；保持顶保证该并不为顶。二元交映到0当且仅当至少一项映到0，给真素性。反向 $h_p$ 保持顶和二元交；任意 $A$ 满足 $\\bigvee A\\le p$ 当且仅当 $A$ 的每项都不超过 $p$，给任意并保持，包含空并。下闭集的并为 $p$，故两个构造严格互逆。本条补的是原书真素元表示，不重复[[14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points]]的完全素滤子定义；二者分别使用点的零逆像与一逆像。"}],"outgoing":["382a1dd68ab6f77b","2f8d75439f8e94de","288974bbe429c3b2"]}